type: software
title: "Coherent Optical System Model Used in Laser Microscopy"
authors:
  - family-names: "Vukušić"
    given-names: "Josip"
  - family-names: "Škaro"
    given-names: "Ana"
repository-code: "https://github.com/josip-vukusic/CoherentOpticalSystemModel"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB research implementation of a coherent optical system for laser
  microscopy, combining Fresnel propagation, transparent-object phase
  modeling, attenuation-grid measurements, and compressive sensing with
  sparse reconstruction.
keywords:
  - computational optics
  - laser microscopy
  - compressive sensing
  - phase imaging
  - Fresnel diffraction
  - MATLAB
